		"en": [
			"• Zaku Mariner, who also appeared in \"Mobile Suit GundamUC episode 4\", appears in the ZZ version.",
			"• Comes with a magnetic harken for towing underwater.",
			"• The towing scene can also be recreated with the included leash.",
			"• Head antennas are included for both general aircraft and commander aircraft.",
			"• There are 2 types of chest parts. A plastic model original Zaku type hatch is included.",
